  "body": "## Summary\n- `ops/ci/install-actionlint.sh` (checksum-pinned 1.7.8, byte-identical to the sibling repos) runs before the taiki-e step, which now installs only shellcheck and cargo-nextest; workflow digest repinned in `ops/ci/workflow-policy.sh` and its hostile test.\n- The real Claude 2.1.266 dogfood recording and the real Portal capture move byte-identically from `docs/readme-media/` (whose stage-one inventory is the 17 synthetic-render files) to `media/dogfood/`, with the rewritten `media/dogfood/README.md`.\n- Bytes were authored and released by the Codex root lane; integrated path-exactly by claude-orch. Fixes the `lint` and `docs` failures on main. The `contract` and `fast` failures are addressed in follow-up commits on this branch.\n\n## Proof\n- Exact tree `e04041e307ab3b56ff51d233c3a6e0d58632fc70`: `ops/ci/workflow-policy.sh` exit 0; `ops/ci/check-links.sh` 91 files passed; `docs/readme-media` inventory = 17.\n- Hosted lanes on this PR are the first hosted evidence for the hub lint body.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015qHQABNS382h2gi5jb5oUY",
